> setRenderPaused(bool) is not needed if we have pauseRender()/resumeRender()

I think keeping `setRenderPaused(bool)` as a slot makes sens, it allows easy connection with signal

```
int ctkVTKAbstractView::pauseRender()
{
  return  this>setRenderPaused(true);
}

int ctkVTKAbstractView::resumeRender()
{
  return  this>setRenderPaused(false);
}
```

